{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The far future is now</strong>. The world is blanketed in garbage and missing its only source of power \u2013 the <strong>Schismatic Engine</strong>. You are a prisoner, forced into the tallest trash-mountain, tasked with finding the Engine. Your ship <i><strong>CRASHES!</strong></i> Leaving you armed with only a cheap replica of the Engine and a cheaper gun. Success will mean your freedom. If you survive... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084300/extras/schismtitle03.png?t=1730235503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084300/extras/SchismGif03.gif?t=1730235503\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 Stats</strong> to invest in as you level up  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>220+ Relics</strong> to power you up with interesting and unique effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>60+ weapons</strong> ranging from practical to insane </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special weapon <strong>Mods</strong> that apply to ALL carried weapons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>24 Gods</strong> that must be appeased \u2013 earning their favor for unique boons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084300/extras/schismtitle02.png?t=1730235503\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084300/extras/SchismGif02.gif?t=1730235503\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by <i>Ikaruga</i>, you can dodge colored bullets by matching their frequency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New rooms start Paused to avoid unfair placements and unavoidable damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful bosses that will put both your skills and build to the test</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084300/extras/schismtitle01.png?t=1730235503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084300/extras/SchismGif01.gif?t=1730235503\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Top-down, action roguelike gameplay - shooting your way to freedom </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mechanical complexity and interactions of traditional roguelikes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chaotic RNG that borrows from roguelikes old and new for infinite replayability </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless mode after the final boss to see how far you can go</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Note: This game is in development and features are subject to change.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Da Reapa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2084300/aee067857a98ef16e68796e4f307c2c363939d05.jpg"},{"name":"Da Reapest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2084300/b93e67daf94676c431b728d023bfa0f4558cd612.jpg"},{"name":"Da Reaperest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2084300/855a94f6009daea96c51282c2064490be43996e6.jpg"},{"name":"Enlightenment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2084300/55b39bc0397f0e5f6209b5b6573100321725e9ae.jpg"},{"name":"All I Need","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2084300/f0d4563b00bb82429acf36faa52fcd919c48256b.jpg"},{"name":"Holier than Thou","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2084300/abeeb7b87f64fd2c84320da626d920fce9d45b4d.jpg"},{"name":"Catch!",